WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.380
The trap card Zero Force!

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:07.280
When my monster leaves the 
field, all other monsters

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:11.060
that have equal or greater attack 
points now have 0 attack points!

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.310
What?

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.020
The gods have 0 attack points!

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.010
They can't attack!

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:25.010
At this turn's End Phase, the Continuous 
Trap Gjallarhorn's effect activates!

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:30.500
Gjallarhorn's effect removes all 
monsters on your field from play,

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.980
and I take damage equal to 
their total attack points.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.750
But your three gods have 0 attack points!

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:40.950
Therefore, I take 0 damage!

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:42.600
No way...

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:47.180
Shooting Star Dragon resurrects 
during the End Phase!

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:53.490
Go, Shooting Star Dragon!  
Attack him directly!

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.460
He did it!

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.070
You did it, Yusei!

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:08.700
You won, Yusei!

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:19.690
The winner of the incredible WRGP 
semifinal battle is Team 5D's!

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:29.420
Well done.  I lose, Yusei Fudo.

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:34.370
I can't believe your goal 
was to activate Odin's Eye.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:38.660
Your wisdom was greater 
than the power of the gods.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:53.420
My Rune Eye is telling me 
that you're our friends.

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:58.280
I'm counting on you.  The fate of 
the world rests on your shoulders.

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:00.740
Yeah, I know.

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:02.700
You did it, Yusei!

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:03.330
Yusei!

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:05.030
Yusei!

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:06.730
Everyone...

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:10.390
Too bad, Harald.

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:12.070
Oh well.

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:20.760
Are you sure it's okay 
to let them handle this?

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:30.160
Yusei Fudo's destiny isn't destruction.

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:34.580
He will guide humanity's potential.

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:37.060
I see.

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:42.240
Riding Duels.

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.430
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:52.260
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:59.990
Run!  The road of evolution 
leading to tomorrow

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:04.360
Is a new legendary duel

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:21.480
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:27.120
Set free your infinite potential

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:32.560
Every beginning is up to you

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:39.060
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:44.440
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:50.270
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:58.080
Become the gale and dance  
Cut through the darkness

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:03.450
Even if you can't see your destination

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:08.990
Run on your feet without fear

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:14.530
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:21.570
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:41.460
Bond Between Friends Leads to the Future

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:52.110
Jack and Crow, we made it this far.

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:58.240
Yeah!  To the WRGP World Riding 
Duel Grand Prix Finals.

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:03.970
It's time to face our goal and 
the danger threatening this city.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.220
Yeah.

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:08.180
We must do whatever it 
takes to win this battle!

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:23.200
Big trouble!

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.680
I won't finish in time!

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.460
Carly, what's going on?

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:30.210
Why did you call us?

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:33.900
We're busy preparing for the WRGP finals.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.680
C'mon, Lua, Luca and Aki!

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:40.230
There are things that I don't know about!

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.210
Please help!

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:44.100
What are you doing?

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:49.470
I have to put together a special 
feature about the WRGP finals.

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:53.100
But I'm nowhere close to 
finishing the article!

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:55.600
So please help me!

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:56.460
Wait a second!

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.160
Is that why you called us?

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:03.570
Section Chief Sagiri, I didn't contact you!

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:06.150
Don't enter without permission!

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:14.080
Even though you didn't call me, I had to come to 
make sure that you're not writing a shady article!

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:17.220
I don't write shady articles!

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:18.340
I don't know that!

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:23.200
If you write that Master Atlas used 
to stay here, you will hurt his image!

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:27.230
Maybe I'll write that Jack is my sweetheart.

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:29.430
You don't have to write lies!

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:29.030
Oh well.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:32.210
Let's leave them alone 
and write it ourselves.

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:32.100
What do you mean by lies?

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:35.380
All right, let's get started!

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:38.870
Let's start by introducing Team 5D's.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:43.900
The Riding Duel team known as 
Team 5D's focuses around Yusei.

00:06:44.010 --> 00:06:48.120
Yusei, Jack, Crow, Luca and 
Aki are duelists with the mark

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:51.790
of the Crimson Dragon.  
They're known as Signers.

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:55.970
First up is Jack.  He takes 
the lead position on the team.

00:06:58.510 --> 00:06:59.760
Jack Atlas.

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:03.590
Jack reigned as Neo Domino City's King.

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:12.210
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:14.260
I'm the King!

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:21.440
But he was actually a fake King 
that Director Godwin created.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:29.500
He used to have too much pride and wasn't entirely 
likable, but he's now a teammate that we can count on.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:32.750
Jack!

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:33.880
Yusei!

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:35.770
Wait a second!

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:38.960
Don't talk about Jack when I'm not around!

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:45.540
It's true that Jack can be uptight, but he's 
actually kind and has a strong sense of justice.

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:47.800
Don't talk like you know him!

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:51.670
I've been with Master Atlas 
much longer than you have!

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.620
That's my line!

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:57.720
Master Atlas's dueling 
style specializes in power.

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.090
Synchro Summon!

00:07:58.070 --> 00:08:00.890
Red Dragon Archfiend symbolizes his power.

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:02.730
Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:08:03.590 --> 00:08:09.930
Now that I know true power, I'm 
not afraid of my own ghost!

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.880
Go, Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.270
Absolute Powerforce!

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:20.000
No matter how powerful the monster, 
Jack's single attack decimates them all!

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:26.990
If you two keep writing about Jack, 
there won't be space for the others.

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:30.450
Can this be a special Jack-only article?

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:32.240
No!

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:39.790
The second member is Team 
5D's trickster, Crow Hogan.

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:44.620
Crow is Yusei and Jack's childhood friend.

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:50.450
He took care of many orphans by himself.

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:55.140
No one can copy Crow's kindness.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:09:01.150
Crow is known for his Black-Winged Dragon!

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:07.550
It fits Crow's personality because it 
damages itself to transform pain into power.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:14.260
It's going well!  It's writing itself!

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:15.600
Next is...

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:17.040
Aki.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.580
Aki Izayoi.

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:22.770
She used to be known as the Black Rose Witch.

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:26.240
Yeah, Aki was scary back then!

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:29.340
C'mon, don't bring up the past!

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:33.860
But Yusei and his friends saved me.

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:38.740
If you didn't help me, I wouldn't be here.

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:41.760
I'm very thankful to everyone.

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:46.480
Now destroy the witch's curse!

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:49.770
Stardust Dragon attacks Black Rose Dragon!

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.560
Shooting Sonic!

00:09:55.810 --> 00:10:00.180
What happened to your psychic powers, Aki?

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:03.560
That power is gone.

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:08.190
I had that power because of 
the darkness in my heart.

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:11.750
But I don't need it anymore.

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:18.840
Because I have friends like you and Yusei.

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:21.690
Let's keep going!

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:23.070
Ta-daa!

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:25.620
Next are the twins.

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:28.680
But I don't have a mark.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:32.190
But you always protect me, Lua.

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:36.210
Really?  I guess Luca needs me!

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:38.350
Sheesh, you always get carried away.

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:42.930
The twins Lua and Luca.

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:47.580
My dragon is Ancient Fairy Dragon.

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:54.070
And Lua uses Power Tool Dragon.

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:56.540
But Lua's dragon is Machine-Type.

00:10:57.570 --> 00:10:58.970
Aki!

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:00.280
Sorry.

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:06.600
The super mechanic Bruno is 
indispensable for Team 5D's.

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:12.020
He had amnesia when he met Yusei.

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:15.380
But when it comes to fixing D-Wheels, 
his skills are first-rate!

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:17.650
Bruno has helped us a lot!

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:21.220
I wonder where Bruno came from?

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:24.380
I feel like I've seen him before.

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:25.960
I might be imagining things.

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:32.860
Someone is spreading rumors about me.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:39.240
And last up is Team 5D's ace Yusei Fudo!

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:40.310
Yeah.

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:46.310
I'm not exaggerating when I say that 
Yusei is the core that unites Team 5D's.

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:51.260
But it's hard to explain Yusei easily.

00:11:51.260 --> 00:11:53.990
Yusei's past is a huge burden for him.

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:56.030
Yusei Fudo.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:12:01.530
His father was Professor Fudo, the man who 
discovered Yusei Particles and developed Moment.

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:07.670
But the evil god that possessed 
Rutger Godwin misused Moment.

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:10.950
And he caused Zero Reverse.

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:17.740
The tragedy of Zero Reverse separated Neo 
Domino City into the City and Satellite.

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:24.950
The evil god's power resurrected the Dark 
Signers for a massive battle against us.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:31.890
The Dark Signers used the old Moment's negative 
spin to try to change Earth into a world of death.

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:35.610
Earthbound Immortal Uru 
can attack you directly!

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:37.270
You'll be defeated in a single blow!

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:39.410
Take this!  Hell Thread!

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:48.470
Yusei blamed himself because he felt that his 
father's research was the cause of the problems.

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:52.590
I've never seen Yusei like that before.

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:58.650
If my father didn't do research, the 
accident 17 years ago wouldn't have happened.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:02.300
That accident took the lives 
of Jack and Crow's parents.

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:05.990
It messed up everyone's lives!

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:12.650
If it never happened, they would have 
caring parents and lived peaceful lives!

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:17.320
But they still regard me as their friend!

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:20.220
They smile at me without saying a word!

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:23.120
What am I supposed to do?

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:25.990
How am I supposed to atone for them?

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:27.950
Yusei...

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:29.280
Answer me!

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.290
Answer me, Rutger!

00:13:32.430 --> 00:13:34.960
That's the darkness in your heart.

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:39.650
That's why Yusei cares more 
about bonds than anyone else.

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:45.700
And he believes that protecting 
Neo Domino City is his mission.

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:51.240
We were able to form Team 
5D's because of Yusei.

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:57.080
We have peace in Neo Domino 
City because of you.

00:13:57.510 --> 00:14:01.640
Thanks to your powers, Neo Domino 
City has become one again.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:08.590
Why?  Didn't Crimson Dragon choose 
me because I'm going to become a god?

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:11.230
You're wrong!  It chose our bond!

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:14.280
With our bond, we will overcome destiny!

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:21.870
The shining stars come together 
to illuminate a new miracle!

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:23.730
Become the path that lights the way!

00:14:24.850 --> 00:14:26.040
Synchro Summon!

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:29.470
Bring the light, Majestic Star Dragon!

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:39.650
Majestic Star Dragon attacks 
Earthbound Immortal Wiraqocha Rasca!

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:42.540
Shooting Blaster Sonic!

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:17.780
By winning the battle against the Dark 
Signers, Neo Domino City finally became one.

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:21.720
And we were supposed to have peace.

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:25.980
“Supposed to?”  What do you mean?

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:28.690
It wasn't the final battle.

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:33.980
Iliaster, the society that secretly 
controlled the Godwin brothers, have started to act.

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:35.670
Really?

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:40.800
They created the World Riding Duel 
Grand Prix, also known as the WRGP.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:41.950
Yes.

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:43.860
The three people from Iliaster...

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:51.890
Jose, Placido and Luciano formed Team 
New World and challenged us to battle.

00:15:53.090 --> 00:16:00.470
Their Meklord Emperors have a terrifying effect 
that allows them to absorb our Synchro Monsters.

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:17.620
Due to Meklord Emperor 
Wisel's effect, it absorbs

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:20.730
a Synchro Monster on your 
field once per turn!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:24.760
That effect is a Synchro killer.

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:26.250
Synchro killer?

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:36.640
They told us what their horrific goal was.

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:41.450
Yusei Fudo, Jack Atlas and Crow Hogan.

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:43.780
The participants have gathered.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:49.320
This monument proves that 
Satellite and City are united.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:54.190
Meeting you here shows the irony of destiny.

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:57.030
So you caused this incident!

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.900
Who are you?

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:02.900
I apologize for not introducing ourselves.

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:05.860
We are Iliaster's three emperors.

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:08.040
Iliaster's three emperors?

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:09.840
Iliaster?

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:13.800
Iliaster?  Why did you do 
this to Neo Domino City?

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:20.020
Iliaster is an organization 
that repairs Earth's history.

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:22.300
Repair history?

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:30.140
Whenever humans headed in the wrong 
direction, we suggested the correct path.

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:36.620
But we learned that no matter how much we 
repair history, there's a future we cannot avoid.

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:44.680
Therefore, we decided to perform a new 
repair in order to get out of this situation.

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:45.880
Repair?

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:49.120
We will destroy Neo Domino City.

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:52.940
Why do you want to destroy Neo Domino City?

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:59.240
If you want to find out, show up at the WRGP.

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:01.830
We'll also enter.

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:03.800
What?  You will?

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:07.430
All will be answered at the WRGP.

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:13.340
I didn't know that happened!

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:19.980
Team 5D's had to keep winning in the 
WRGP so that we could battle Iliaster.

00:18:20.230 --> 00:18:23.960
But can Team 5D's defeat them?

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:25.620
Don't worry!

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:31.400
Jack and Yusei gained new 
powers for the battle!

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:32.880
New powers?

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:37.100
With the Crimson Dragon's 
power, I'll creates miracles!

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:40.120
My rugged soul!

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:44.470
I'll use its power to 
seal Crimson Devil again!

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:49.410
The king and devil now 
merge here!  Rugged soul!

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:52.130
Give the roar that created heaven and earth!

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:53.620
Synchro Summon!

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:56.720
Come, Red Nova Dragon!

00:18:58.690 --> 00:19:02.380
Jack's ultimate power Red Nova Dragon!

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.220
Clear Mind!

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:14.370
Level 2 Synchro Tuner Formula Synchron tunes 
Level 8 Synchro Monster Stardust Dragon!

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:19.530
Dreams crystallize to open 
a new door of evolution!

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.590
Become the path that lights the way!

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:28.120
Accel Synchro!

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:33.120
He vanished?

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:38.820
Arise!  Shooting Star Dragon!

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:46.200
Yusei acquired the ultimate 
evolution Shooting Star Dragon.

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:10.350
Yeah.

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:18.090
With Jack's Red Nova Dragon and Yusei's 
Shooting Star Dragon, we can win.

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:21.500
I see!

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:25.640
Thanks to you, I'm putting 
together an incredible article!

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:26.600
That's good.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:29.520
That means our help was worth it.

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:30.690
Hello.

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:36.940
I heard that you were working, so I brought 
you Jack's favorite drink Blue-Eyes Mountain.

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:57.400
The article!

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:58.300
Hot!

00:20:58.300 --> 00:20:59.400
Are you okay, Lua?

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.410
Did you show up just to do this?

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:03.140
I'm sorry!

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:08.640
Everything is as planned.

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:17.120
When Team New World wins the WRGP 
finals, the Circuit will be completed.

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:25.030
That's when a new doorway to destruction 
will open in Neo Domino City.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:36.200
Just wait, Iliaster!

00:21:36.300 --> 00:21:38.910
We'll defeat you!

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:44.120
And we promise to protect Neo Domino City!

00:22:06.470 --> 00:22:11.680
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:17.050
If we shed the same tears, 
let's laugh together

00:22:17.180 --> 00:22:22.420
Freed reality forms phrases 
in the piercing beat

00:22:22.550 --> 00:22:25.160
Our hearts resonate

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:30.400
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:30.530 --> 00:22:37.040
We'll find a place for us

00:22:38.940 --> 00:22:43.810
Waking in a dream  Stretch 
our hands toward the future

00:22:43.810 --> 00:22:48.880
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:49.610 --> 00:22:55.050
Repaint the darkness with 
the colors we envision

00:22:55.050 --> 00:23:03.630
Overlaying memories, bonds 
and hope creates future color

00:23:03.630 --> 00:23:09.230
We will draw it forever
